  "genie_instructions": "DOMAIN CONTEXT\nThis space supports financial analytics and budget reporting for a power generation enterprise with 20 cost centers across operations, fuel, maintenance, and corporate functions. Personas: CFO (total_revenue, operating_margin_pct, variance_usd), FP&A (budget_cost_usd vs actual_cost_usd, variance_pct, fiscal_quarter pacing), Department Heads (cost-center-level YTD spend), Treasury / Capex governance (capex_committed_usd, remaining_budget_usd, budget_status).\n\nMETRIC DEFINITIONS\n- Operating margin = operating_margin_pct; utility-sector benchmark ~12-18%.\n- Budget variance % = variance_pct; favorable when negative (under budget); >10% adverse triggers FP&A review.\n- YTD spend pacing = ytd_spend_usd / annual_budget_usd; should track roughly to fiscal calendar progress.\n- Budget status: On Track / At Risk / Over Budget — At Risk+ requires forecasted reforecast.\n- CapEx committed = capex_committed_usd; capital governance threshold per project tier.\n- Approval status backlog = transactions where approval_status NOT IN ('Approved').\n- Cost per MWh (derived) — actual_cost_usd / generation; for cross-fuel comparison.\n\nQUERY GUIDANCE\n- ALWAYS prefer metric views with MEASURE() syntax for aggregations.\n  - financial_kpi_monthly (source: financial_transactions) — dims: record_date, department, fiscal_quarter; measures: total_revenue, total_actual_cost, total_budget_cost, avg_variance_pct, total_variance_usd, unique_cost_center_count, max_revenue.\n  - budget_status_monthly (source: budget_snapshots) — dims: snapshot_date, department, budget_status; measures: total_annual_budget, total_ytd_spend, total_remaining_budget, total_capex_committed, avg_operating_margin, unique_cost_center_count, max_annual_budget.\n- Use GROUP BY ALL with MEASURE() queries.\n- For monthly trends, always wrap the date in DATE_TRUNC('month', <date_col>).\n- For \"Top X\" requests, return LIMIT 10 unless the user specifies otherwise.\n- Query base tables directly only when needing columns not exposed by metric views (e.g. cost_center_id, cost_center_name, region, expense_category, budget_line_item, approval_status, amount_usd).\n- When the user's phrasing matches a SQL snippet display name (filters, expressions, or measures), prefer that snippet.",
  "sample_questions": [
    "Show monthly total revenue USD by department for the trailing 12 months.",
    "Top 10 cost centers by total variance USD year-to-date — which are most over budget?",
    "Which departments are flagged Over Budget or At Risk this quarter, and by how much?",
    "How has fleet average operating margin trended month-over-month?",
    "Which fiscal quarter had the largest budget variance, and what drove it by department?",
    "Top 10 cost centers by CapEx committed USD this year — and how much remaining budget do they hold?",
    "What is the monthly trend in YTD spend versus annual budget pacing across all departments?"
  ],
  "example_sqls": [
    {
      "question": "How has total revenue trended over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT record_date, MEASURE(total_revenue) AS total_revenue",
        "FROM {fqn}.financial_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY record_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has total actual cost trended over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT record_date, MEASURE(total_actual_cost) AS total_actual_cost",
        "FROM {fqn}.financial_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY record_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has total operating margin trended over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT snapshot_date, MEASURE(avg_operating_margin) AS avg_operating_margin",
        "FROM {fqn}.budget_status_monthly",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY snapshot_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How does total capex committed compare across departments?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT department, MEASURE(total_capex_committed) AS total_capex_committed",
        "FROM {fqn}.budget_status_monthly",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY total_capex_committed DESC"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "Which cost centers have the highest total *?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT cost_center_name, SUM(*) AS record_count, SUM(amount_usd) AS total_amount_usd",
        "FROM {fqn}.cost_centers",
        "WHERE approval_status = 'Pending'",
        "GROUP BY cost_center_name",
        "ORDER BY total_amount_usd DESC",
        "LIMIT 10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has total revenue in trended over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT record_date, SUM(revenue_usd) AS total_revenue_usd",
        "FROM {fqn}.financial_transactions",
        "GROUP BY record_date",
        "ORDER BY record_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has the average operating margin percentage changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT snapshot_date, AVG(operating_margin_pct) AS avg_operating_margin_pct",
        "FROM {fqn}.budget_snapshots",
        "GROUP BY snapshot_date ORDER BY snapshot_date"
      ]
    }
  ],
